WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.950
The first few minutes set the
tone for everything after them.

2
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.888
Start on time, every time.

3
00:00:04.888 --> 00:00:09.125
Open by stating the purpose, confirming
the agenda and naming the roles,

4
00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:12.500
and point people to the notes,
slides and chat you're using.

5
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.703
Agree on a few ground
rules, such as take space,

6
00:00:15.703 --> 00:00:18.213
make space, so the air time is shared.

7
00:00:18.213 --> 00:00:23.637
From then on, follow the agenda, and leave
it only deliberately, for a set time.

8
00:00:23.637 --> 00:00:25.024
Summarize as you go.

9
00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:26.691
And when someone arrives late,

10
00:00:26.691 --> 00:00:30.488
point them to the agenda and the
notes rather than recapping for them.

11
00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:32.876
So what happens to the
topics that don't fit?

12
00:00:32.876 --> 00:00:34.820
That's the job of the parking lot.
